model law_defs
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-10
  start 2026-03-01
  end 2026-06-30
  note "T, tally 2.3 (#247), the round's mutation run (book/adjust.rs NamedReads::touched_by, a def's reads): pw's day and its at are window rows and its amount is a def's, which may read any index's keys, so ui, adding a key to people, touches what pw names: an adjustment whose existence is the hole (E §5 step 2; law_hole.tally holds the move with no def)"

source s "invented"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

kind people: parties

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place other: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

input amt: money PLN
input w: date
input wa: date

def amt_d: money PLN = amt

move pw: transfers
  on w
  at wa
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt_d

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 100.00 PLN "s"
  w = window(2026-03-05, 2026-03-25) "s"
  wa = window(2026-03-01, 2026-03-03) "s"
  people + [ann] lives 2020-01-01..
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-03-01 start "s"
  opening[other] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-03-01 start "s"

version ui
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-03-21
  people + [bob] lives 2020-01-01..

ask adj: count(a in adjustments over 2026-03 .. 2026-04)
ask keys: count(p in people on 2026-04-01)
